old pitchers like the one facing **Jackson Merrill** and **Andy Pages**, the current data indicates the aggressive base-running profiles of these hitters outweigh the potential loss of efficiency. No weather alerts are currently threatening play, so we are proceeding with this lineup as the most robust construction to maximize our 5x5 category targets.",
